    "faq-content-2": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What Shipping Methods Are Available?",
            "answer": "<p>We ship using all major carriers such as USPS, UPS & FedEx. All Shipments are fully insured by us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is shipping free?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer Free Ground Shipping on all domestic orders. You have the ability to upgrade to 2nd Day Shipping if you like.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fCcEwk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we ship worldwide on most items. Please note that the cost of shipping varies depending on the jurisdiction. </p><p>Items in your order that are designated for shipment to countries outside the United States may be subject to taxes, custom duties and fees levied by the destination country (\"Import Fees\"). This is the responsibility of the importer/recipient. </p><p>Milano is not responsible for any Customs Duties or Taxes that are applicable in your country. </p><p>If you refuse a shipment from Milano, you are responsible for the original shipping charges, any import fees that are incurred on the package, and the cost of returning the package back to Milano. This amount will be deducted from your refund.</p><p>We are happy to work with you to get your jewelry to you safely, smoothly and quickly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_zBebQU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When can I expect to receive my Milano order?",
            "answer": "<p>We work to ship your purchase to you as quickly as possible, but factors like personalization and vendor lead times may impact timelines. All in stock items are shipped during business days. Please allow a minimum of 3-5 days processing time for us to ship your order out. Once your order has been shipped, you will receive your order depending on the method of shipment chosen at checkout. Should you have any questions about your order, please do not hesitate to <a href=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RFkzhy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship to a P.O. Box?",
            "answer": "<p>We only ship to APO, FPO, DPO. We do not ship to regular post boxes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_jmKzmQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Once your order has shipped, you will receive a notification containing the tracking number. You can use the tracking number on the respective Carrier website or you can check the status over <a href=\"/pages/track-your-order\" title=\"Track Your Order\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RKcHLB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will my order take?",
            "answer": "<p>Most of our jewelry is made to order. Each item has a different lead time (generally 10-15 business days) which is specified under the product details. Once an item ships, it should arrive within 2-3 business days within the United States and 5-10 business days internationally. If your purchase is a gift and you will not receive it in time, please <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact Us\">contact us</a> and we can send an email with a gift notification to the recipient, informing them that a Milano Gift is on the way.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
