    "collapsible_tabs_Diaytk": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_meab7W": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your refund policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer free returns on all eligible U.S. domestic online orders (in-store purchases are Final Sale). If for any reason you're unsatisfied with your purchase, you may return your online purchase for a refund, exchange or merchandise credit within 30 calendar days of the shipment. The item must be unworn, unblemished, unaltered and in it's original state. Purchases beyond 30 calendar days are only eligible for upgrades or store credit. Please refer to our upgrade policy for more information. </p><p>Customized, Engraved and Personalized items (Ex. name jewelry) are not eligible for refunds. You may upgrade it or exchange it for an item of equal or greater value. These exchanges are subject to a 20% restocking fee and subject to shipping/duty costs.</p><p>Customers may return a product up to two times within 30 days of receipt. Any purchases beyond that is only eligible for 100% store credit or can incur a 20% restocking fee. Each order is eligible for 1 Shipping Label. If additional items need to be shipped back in a separate package, a $25 shipping fee will be deducted from your refund.</p><p><strong>Please note that the following items are not eligible for return:</strong></p><ul><li>Diamond and Jewelry Upgrades</li><li>Jewelry with lost diamonds</li><li>Jewelry or Diamonds that have chips, scratches, breaks or nicks</li><li>Jewelry that has been worked on, resized or repaired by another jeweler</li></ul><p>All orders are considered final sale after the initial 30-day period.</p><p>All refunds (not including shipping or sizing charges if applicable) will be refunded to your original method of payment. Please allow up to two weeks for it to reflect on your bank statement. Our refund policies do not apply to Final Sales and Custom Orders. Please <a href=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us </a>to find out what your options are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_fAYePB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I return a purchase?",
            "answer": "<p><a href=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> in order to process your refunds. Once approved we will provide you with an authorization # as well as a refund slip that must be included with the return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_aGKMCf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I exchange my purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>All exchanges require approval. Approved exchanges are accepted for items purchased online or in store only. Shipping, taxes and duties are not applicable towards exchange credit. </p><p>Customized, Engraved or Personalized orders are considered final sale. Depending on the product, they may be exchanged subject to a 15% restocking fee if an exchange is requested.</p><p>All non-jewelry and accessory items are Final Sale and not applicable for exchange.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_bGwiFN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will my refund take to process?",
            "answer": "<p>Once we receive the return shipment, we will assess the item to ensure it's unworn, unblemished and untampered. Upon completion of this we will process your refund. Please allow up to two weeks for the refund to be processed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_dNQB6g": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I cancel an order?",
            "answer": "<p>Please <a href=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shopmilano.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> directly in order to cancel an order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_YW3fip": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I return an In-Store Purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>Please refer to the back of your Milano receipt for our In-Store return policy details. If your purchase is eligible for a return, please submit your return by <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contacting Us</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
