    "collapsible_tabs_cPChgz": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_EwaKrH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my Jewelry?",
            "answer": "<p>Jewelry made out of precious metals and gemstones are delicate and require constant upkeep and care. If cared for properly fine jewelry can become a treasured family heirloom!<br/><br/>Dust, pollution and daily wear all cause the brilliance and shine of metals and gemstones to become dull and cloudy. We recommend professional cleaning and servicing at least once a year. Stop by any of our locations for complimentary servicing.</p><p>In between servicing, store your jewelry safely in a jewelry case. Prior to storage, wipe your jewelry of any fluids that it may have come in contact with throughout the day. Examine your jewelry on a regular basis and take care to protect your jewelry from impact against hard surfaces or abrasive surfaces.</p><p>You can clean your gemstones at home to prevent any clouding. For diamonds, use a mild solution of water and soap and gently brush with a soft bristle. For softer gemstones such as pearls, simply wipe gently with a damp cloth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6CMCPC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your repair policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Jewelry is delicate and when it becomes a part of your daily life, it's natural for the metals to wear down with time. Prongs may become loose being pulled on by strands in our clothes, chains can be weakened and break by the occasional unintentional tug. Milano stands by the manufacturing of it's products and has a lifetime warranty on all repair charges that stem from manufacturing defects. In the event of a lost diamond or gemstone, the cost of  the diamonds and/or gemstones are the responsibility of the customer. We guarantee all repairs for 6 months.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_VJQ9WB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I get an Appraisal?",
            "answer": "<p>Please contact us directly to get an appraisal for your purchase. Items valued at over $1,000 are eligible for a free Milano Appraisal. <br/><br/>If you would like a Certified Independent Appraisal, you may purchase it for $65. We offer all purchases over $500 the option to get a Certified Independent 3rd Party Appraisal. Please note, this must be requested at the time of purchase. Certified Appraisals add 3 days to your shipping time. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_LULqiW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you resize Jewelry?",
            "answer": "<p>Most of our rings can be resized. Pricing for ring sizing varies depending on style and the variation in size required. Pricing starts at $50. Shipping and other similar expenses will be the responsibility of the customer.</p><p>We cannot accept the responsibility for items repaired by any other jeweler (including sizing). This will void any and all warranty.</p><p>To request a resizing please <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact Us.</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
