    "collapsible_tabs_43ikMm": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_PEC9Rz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your upgrade policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Milano offers a lifetime upgrade policy on all items purchased in store and online. Upgrades will be honored only on items at least double the value of the item purchased. The item being upgraded must be in good condition and accompanied by an invoice. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_jzfKck": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer Insurance?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, Milano partners with Lavalier to offer comprehensive insurance coverage for all our customers. Lavalier's insurance coverage is more comprehensive than the jewelry coverage on your homeowners insurance. It covers everything from damage to theft and allows a smooth replacement process.<br/><br/>Get your quote here: <a href=\"https://lavalier.com/milanodg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://lavalier.com/milanodg\">https://lavalier.com/milanodg</a></p><p>To prove our confidence in Lavalier's insurance, we offer a 100% credit of your first years premium towards a future purchase with a value of 2.5x the credit amount. Contact us to find out more information.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_BEnQtg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My size is not available",
            "answer": "<p>If your size is not available, please contact us. While we try to stock a lot of sizes, we're unable to have every size at all times. We are still able to fulfill most orders and custom sizes. Sizes not listed require sizing and can add an additional 3-5 days processing time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_EidydC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you price match?",
            "answer": "<p>We will price match for identical items at a lower price. The lower price must be verifiable and from an authentic source. Price matching will not be honored after purchase.</p><p>Price matching does not apply to Marketplaces (Amazon, Facebook, Ebay). Offers that include financing, item bundles, free gifts, pricing errors, out-of-stock or used goods are not eligible for price match.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_HUfDkn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Milano's products conflict-free",
            "answer": "<p>All our diamonds, gemstones and metals are sourced responsibly and ethically. By being vertically integrated, Milano is able to ensure it adheres to all necessary rules and regulations.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ppXLPd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are all Milano Jewelry Made-to-Order?",
            "answer": "<p>Most of our products are made-to-order. Milano aims to minimize excess inventory and the negative impact excess inventory has on the environment. By making each piece to order, we can can offer a larger selection of beautiful jewelry.</p><p>We do however, stock our <a href=\"/collections/best-sellers\" title=\"Best Sellers\">Best Sellers</a>. If you're in a rush for a gift, please browse our on hand inventory that ships within 2-3 business days.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
